## Summary Matrix

| Problem                     | IndexedDB Mechanism          | Best Solution / Pattern                                                                           |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Simultaneous Writes**     | `readwrite` transaction lock | Use narrow object store scopes; perform read-modify-write inside the same transaction scope.      |
| **Blocked Schema Upgrades** | `versionchange` lock         | Listen for `db.onversionchange` in all active tabs and invoke `db.close()`.                       |
| **Cross-Tab Data Stale UI** | *No native support*          | Emit mutation messages via `BroadcastChannel` to notify other open tabs to re-query the database. |

Explain how to manage IndexedDB inside a SharedWorker with code examples

Managing IndexedDB inside a **SharedWorker** centralizes all client-side database reads, writes, and schema migrations into a single, multi-tab thread.

Instead of having 5 open browser tabs spawning 5 separate IndexedDB connections—which leads to `versionchange` locks, schema upgrade blocks, and race conditions—all tabs delegate database interactions to the SharedWorker through a unified `MessagePort` architecture.

---

## 1. Architectural Overview

```text
┌─────────────────┐       MessagePort.postMessage({ type: 'ADD_USER' })
│ Tab 1 (Client)  │ ──────────────────────────────────────────┐
└─────────────────┘                                           │
                                                              ▼
┌─────────────────┐       MessagePort.postMessage(...)    ┌────────────────────────┐
│ Tab 2 (Client)  │ ─────────────────────────────────► │ SharedWorker           │
└─────────────────┘                                   │  - Single IDB Connection│
                                                      │  - Handles Locks/State │
┌─────────────────┐       MessagePort.postMessage(...)    └───────────┬────────────┘
│ Tab 3 (Client)  │ ──────────────────────────────────────────┘           │
└─────────────────┘                                                       │
                                                                          ▼
                                                              ┌────────────────────────┐
                                                              │ IndexedDB Engine       │
                                                              └────────────────────────┘

```

